      "balloons": [
        {
          "panel": "N3-01",
          "text": "The next morning.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-01",
          "text": "You found me without the shouting.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-02",
          "text": "That is the knock. Thank you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-03",
          "text": "Same time tomorrow?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-03",
          "text": "Same time.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-04",
          "text": "After the collection run.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-04",
          "text": "Morning round complete.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-04",
          "text": "This part is for the room.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-05",
          "text": "The survey includes your carrying time.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-05",
          "text": "ArenThen tell me what you need moved.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-08",
          "text": "It is waiting for the light to move.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-09",
          "text": "Use the public stair while we check the lamp.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-10",
          "text": "The old feed is capped. This branch has no date.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-11",
          "text": "Here. A separate branch from the pump cabinet.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-11",
          "text": "SeraThe lamp branch only. The homes keep their water.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-14",
          "text": "ArenThere you are.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-15",
          "text": "The shade is turned toward the suspension. The guide pane is below it.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-16",
          "text": "RuskThe light can reach the guide without washing the whole landing.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-17",
          "text": "The shade is enough. Take the tools by the stair.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-18",
          "text": "SeraFixed post. Clear shelf. I will watch the landing.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-22",
          "text": "The collar is outside the light path.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-26",
          "text": "A light test load followed.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-26",
          "text": "A mail load. Nothing extra.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-27",
          "text": "This circuit. These two stops. Mail only.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-28",
          "text": "We can hand it over here?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-28",
          "text": "DainWithout that bell?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-28",
          "text": "Here. Quietly.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-29",
          "text": "At midday.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-29",
          "text": "Observed supply. Corrected light path. One tested postal circuit.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-30",
          "text": "The witnessed addresses are back in the current register. Regular collection is approved.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-31",
          "text": "The old instruction is enclosed. Your correction has to travel with its history.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-32",
          "text": "Lower Post. I know the door.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-35",
          "text": "They have sent us an answer.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-36",
          "text": "Rusk. Hessa. Dain. In the current register.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-36",
          "text": "RuskThen she can write back.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-37",
          "text": "Please keep that one.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-37",
          "text": "I intend to.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-38",
          "text": "Carrying work complete.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-38",
          "text": "ArenThen I can sit for this one.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-39",
          "text": "This instruction closes Bell Basin too.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-39",
          "text": "RuskI bought hinges there last month.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N3-40",
          "text": "ArenThen we take them a copy. After the morning post.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
